;; Camera image on real hardware. Checked in as a deliberately failing fixture.
;;
;; It composes cleanly and fails `silt check --buildroot`: libcamera has
;; `depends on !BR2_STATIC_LIBS` and profile:minimal sets static libs. That
;; conflict lives in Buildroot's Kconfig, not in any fragment, so compose alone
;; cannot see it — which is the whole reason the verifier exists.
;;
;; `silt solve` on this must produce testdata/edge-camera.expected, and that file
;; is asserted like any other test. Explanation quality is the subjective part of
;; this project and therefore the part most likely to rot quietly; pinning the
;; output is the only guard against that.

(image edge-camera

  (compose
    target:rpi4-64
    profile:minimal
    feature:networking
    feature:wifi
    feature:camera)

  (repair-policy
    (minimize changed-symbols)
    (keep target)))
